      "source_sha256": "413f2453c602678962fab62446144f2929fcd5b9239f209c7889cc592d2b5be8",
      "summary": "启动后先确认能开始操作，再试玩核心动作并为代表性状态留截图。分别核对界面和渲染，最后按严重程度报告问题并给出复现步骤。"
    },
    {
      "id": "tooling",
      "file": "skills/game-playtest/SKILL.md",
      "heading": "Tooling Guidance",
      "url": "https://github.com/openai/plugins/blob/0722921d5542fc593105c27bd52630babd8b8c2a/plugins/game-studio/skills/game-playtest/SKILL.md#tooling-guidance",
      "lines": [
        "screenshots are mandatory because DOM assertions alone miss visual regressions."
      ],
      "source_sha256": "413f2453c602678962fab62446144f2929fcd5b9239f209c7889cc592d2b5be8",
      "summary": "优先使用仓库已有的 Playwright 或同类工具。大量使用 Canvas 或 WebGL 的游戏需要截图，单靠 DOM 断言容易漏掉显示问题。难以稳定自动化时，按步骤人工试玩并留证。"
    },
    {
      "id": "reporting",
      "file": "skills/game-playtest/SKILL.md",
      "heading": "Reporting Standard",
      "url": "https://github.com/openai/plugins/blob/0722921d5542fc593105c27bd52630babd8b8c2a/plugins/game-studio/skills/game-playtest/SKILL.md#reporting-standard",
      "lines": [
        "- what the user sees",
        "- how to reproduce it",
        "- why it matters"
      ],
      "source_sha256": "413f2453c602678962fab62446144f2929fcd5b9239f209c7889cc592d2b5be8",
      "summary": "先列发现。每条写清玩家看到的情况、复现方式、影响和可能负责的子系统。"
    },
